          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "\n<style>\n.mm-hero{background:#123d43;color:#f1f5ec;border-radius:20px;padding:36px 40px;margin:8px 0 22px}\n.mm-kicker{font:700 11px/1.5 ui-sans-serif,system-ui;letter-spacing:.17em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a9cbc4}\n.mm-hero h1{font:600 clamp(32px,5vw,58px)/1.08 ui-sans-serif,system-ui;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:15px 0 15px}\n.mm-hero p{font:400 16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui;max-width:780px;color:#d0e1da}\n.mm-hero .mm-credit{font-size:12px;color:#adc9c1;margin-top:22px}\n.mm-panel{border:1px solid #d7e2db;background:#f6f9f5;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;margin:10px 0}\n.mm-section{font:700 11px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4d7775;margin-top:24px}\n.mm-details{font:400 13px/1.7 ui-sans-serif,system-ui;color:#24444a}\n.mm-control-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,280px),1fr));gap:14px 20px;max-width:100%}\n.mm-control-grid>div{min-width:0}\n.mm-table-scroll{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto}\n.mm-table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:720px;font:400 12px/1.7 ui-sans-serif,system-ui}\n.mm-table th{text-align:left;border-bottom:2px solid #dae4dd;padding:8px;color:#355d60}\n.mm-table td{padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #e6eee7;vertical-align:top}\n.mm-table .pass{color:#14664f;font-weight:650}.mm-table .fail{color:#a83d44;font-weight:650}.mm-table .unresolved{color:#8a620d;font-weight:650}\n@media(max-width:640px){.mm-hero{padding:25px 22px}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"mm-hero\">\n  <div class=\"mm-kicker\">OpenADMET \u00d7 marimo \u00b7 an interactive evidence lab</div>\n  <h1>The Missing Molecules</h1>\n  <p>How much can we trust an ADMET shortlist when some assays were never measured,\n  and others only tell us \u201cabove\u201d or \u201cbelow\u201d a detection limit?</p>\n  <p>Move a threshold. Inspect a structure. Discover which decisions the evidence can settle.</p>\n  <div class=\"mm-credit\">Harsh Pandey \u00b7 ExpansionRx / OpenADMET data \u00b7 AI-assisted development disclosed below</div>\n</section>\n"
          }
        }
      ],
