    {
      "id": "lDEv",
      "code_hash": "ef4e1b39c8a548855c55e8dbb7356057",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div class=\"mm-section\">02 \u00b7 What did cleaning the data erase?</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Keeping the assay bounds settles <strong>162 additional passes</strong> and\n<strong>100 additional failures</strong> under your current gates.\nThese decisions use information already present in the raw data; no model or imputation is involved.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Takeaway:</strong> discarding assay limits makes <strong>262 of 7,618\nmolecule-ID decisions unresolved</strong> (3.4% of this population).\nKeeping the bounds narrows the compatible shortlist from\n<strong>1,682\u20135,170</strong> to\n<strong>1,844\u20135,070</strong>.\nThe numbers follow the gates you choose; they describe this release and these illustrative\nthresholds, without modeling assay uncertainty beyond the published inequalities.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A censored value can be sufficient evidence even when it is unsuitable as an exact\nregression target. Flip <strong>\u201cdiscard censored measurements\u201d</strong> above and watch the\nlogical bounds widen or stay unchanged.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='lDEv-0' random-id='1198a4ef-7ffc-1ea7-3515-695269a1440c'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;Evidence policy&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Use exact values and assay bounds&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Established passes&#92;&quot;:1844,&#92;&quot;Established failures&#92;&quot;:2548,&#92;&quot;Unresolved&#92;&quot;:3226,&#92;&quot;Compatible shortlist&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;1844\u20135070&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Evidence policy&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Discard every censored value&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Established passes&#92;&quot;:1682,&#92;&quot;Established failures&#92;&quot;:2448,&#92;&quot;Unresolved&#92;&quot;:3488,&#92;&quot;Compatible shortlist&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;1682\u20135170&#92;&quot;}]&quot;' data-total-rows='2' data-total-columns='5' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element></div>"
          }
        }
