            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div class=\"mm-section\">04 \u00b7 Which measurement could settle a decision?</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Single unresolved gate:</strong> resolving this one assay would settle that molecule's\nstatus under the current criteria, whether it passes or fails. Other unresolved\ngates can also matter: a failure could reject the molecule, while a pass might\nleave further assays to resolve.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The counts below measure <strong>decision opportunity</strong>, not expected success, monetary\nvalue, or a guarantee that a repeated assay would return an uncensored result.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='HrUU-0' random-id='15ccde61-21f2-7948-886e-01e2a1251bdb'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;Assay&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Caco-2 permeability A\u2192B&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Only unresolved gate&#92;&quot;:1092,&#92;&quot;Unresolved gate in otherwise viable IDs&#92;&quot;:2815,&#92;&quot;Focused on board&#92;&quot;:false},{&#92;&quot;Assay&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Human microsomal clearance&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Only unresolved gate&#92;&quot;:392,&#92;&quot;Unresolved gate in otherwise viable IDs&#92;&quot;:2070,&#92;&quot;Focused on board&#92;&quot;:false},{&#92;&quot;Assay&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Kinetic solubility&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Only unresolved gate&#92;&quot;:7,&#92;&quot;Unresolved gate in otherwise viable IDs&#92;&quot;:115,&#92;&quot;Focused on board&#92;&quot;:true}]&quot;' data-total-rows='3' data-total-columns='4' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data